  "management_type_reason": "おぎはら楽天・品種: 剪定は花後のみ。RHS・品種は剪定グループ4、MBG・NC State（種）も花後に剪定、冬傷みの枝は早春に除く",
  "management_type_quote": "Prune after flowering by cutting back flowering stems to a pair of healthy buds.",
