  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[おぎはら 強・欧米 弱] おぎはら自身も楽天のページで蒸れ・暖地の日かげの注意を書いているので、中 にした\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 日照 寒冷地: 日向〜明るい半日陰／暖地: 明るい半日陰（西日 × 相当）\n[NC State/種] Although this plant can be grown in sun or partial shade, it is a native of Asia and prefers cool growing conditions and will grow best in light to open shade.\n[NC State/種] In warmer climates, a location protected from hot sun will keep the foliage and flowers from prematurely fading or scorching and it will flower more prolifically with consistent summer watering.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（種の記述）は 弱 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: East-facing or North-facing or West-facing",
